  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 104.01 Office Location and Mailing Address, Office Hours, Telephone Number, and TTY/TDD Access.\n\n(a) The board's office is located at:\n\nNew Hampshire Naturopathic Board of Examiners\n\nOffice of Professional Licensure and Certification\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord, N.H. 03301\n\n(b) The office shall be open to the public weekdays, excluding holidays, from 8:00 A.M. to 4:00 P.M.\n\n(c) The board's telephone number at the office of professional licensure and certification is (603) 271-2152.\n\n(d) Access to the board for in-state TTY/TDD users is through Relay New Hampshire by dialing 1-800-735-2964.\n\n(e) Persons wishing to make submissions to, or requests of, the board may mail a letter to the board at the address stated in paragraph (a), call the number stated in paragraph (c), or communicate by TTY/TDD using the number stated in paragraph (d).\n\nSource. #6379, eff 11-26-96; ss by #8299, eff 3-9-05; paras (c) and (e) EXPIRED: 7-1-16 pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II and 2015, 276:45 and 276:97; ss by #12337, eff 7-22-17; ss by #14392, eff 9-30-25",
